femticPy patch 0001-write_observe-frequency-precision

Rationale: write_observe printed frequencies with '%.5f', rounding the Vulcan long-period bands by up to 3 % (1.26263e-4 -> 0.00013; 1.2553e-3 -> 0.00126); '%.6e' keeps 7 significant digits.

--- a/src/femticPy.py
+++ b/src/femticPy.py
@@ -382,7 +382,7 @@
